  "raw_block": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Rec Swim Hours</h3>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rec swim hours are subject to change; check the website regularly before coming in*.</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lanes are available on a first-come, first-served basis during the following times for recreational lap swimming only.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*<strong><em>Updated 11</em></strong>/<strong><em>8/26</em></strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Comp Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 11/9: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 11/10: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 11/11: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 11/12: 12pm-2pm <em><em>*USC hosting </em></em>a <em><em>Dive Meet</em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 11/13: 12pm-2pm <em><em>*USC hosting </em></em>a <em><em>Dive Meet</em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 11/14: 12pm-2pm<br/><em><em>*USC hosting Swim &amp; Dive Meet</em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 11/15: 11am-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Dive Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 11/9: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 11/10: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 11/11: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 11/12: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm <br/><em><em>*USC hosting </em></em>a <em><em>Dive Meet</em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 11/13: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm <br/><em>*<em><em>USC hosting </em></em>a <em><em>Dive Meet</em></em></em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 11/14: CLOSED<br/><em>*USC hosting a Dive Meet</em></p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 11/15: CLOSED</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>"
